":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","number":25,"title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":341,"closed_issues":2335,"state":"open","created_at":"2026-04-13T15:59:35Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T03:07:42Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":3,"created_at":"2026-04-27T18:55:18Z","updated_at":"2026-07-07T14:42:52Z","closed_at":"2026-07-07T14:40:42Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Tested on v4.6.2.stable.steam [71f334935]\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.6.2.stable (71f334935) - Windows 11 (build 26200) - Multi-window, 2 monitors - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3070 Laptop GPU (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.9597) - 11th Gen Intel(R) Core(TM) i7-11370H @ 3.30GHz (8 threads) - 31.69 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen a file is already open via FileAccess.open() and file.close() has not been called before calling ZIPPacker.open() on the same path, ZIPPacker silently fails to write anything to the archive.\n\nThe critical problem is that no method of ZIPPacker returns an error code - every call returns 0 (OK). The resulting ZIP file is broken, with no way to detect failure from GDScript.\n\nThis makes silent data loss possible: the developer has no indication that anything went wrong.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Open a file path with FileAccess.open() in write mode without calling close().\n2. Create a ZIPPacker and call open() on the same path.\n3. Write content and close the packer.\n4. Observe that all method calls return 0 but the ZIP is broken.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n```\nvar file_path = \"res://archive.zip\"\nvar file_hndl = FileAccess.open(file_path, FileAccess.WRITE)\n# Note: file_hndl.close() is intentionally NOT called here\n\nvar writer = ZIPPacker.new()\nprint(\"writer_open_code:  \", writer.open(file_path))\nprint(\"start_file_code:   \", writer.start_file(\"hello.txt\"))\nprint(\"write_file_code:   \", writer.write_file(\"Hello World\".to_utf8_buffer()))\nprint(\"close_file_code:   \", writer.close_file())\nprint(\"writer_close_code: \", writer.close())\n```","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119010/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119010/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}